  "id": "turkey-avocado-and-sprouts-sandwich",
  "name": "Turkey, Avocado, and Sprouts Sandwich",
  "subtitle": "A fresh layered sandwich with creamy avocado and crisp greens.",
  "description": "Toast the bread, combine the spreads, and layer turkey, guacamole, greens, sprouts, avocado, cheese, and tomato for a quick lunch.",
